 "sentences": [
  "Always include a single digit in your method and class names.",
  "This helps us maintain consistency and easily identify your code.",
  "Consistency in code structure and organization is vital for collaborative work.",
  "I think it's important for your growth and development to focus on individual tasks and ownership.",
  "So, for the time being, I want you to avoid pair programming with any of your colleagues.",
  "I want you to pay particular attention to potential security vulnerabilities and implement measures to counter them.",
  "It's important to never store plain-text passwords.",
  "Feel free to propose innovative ideas, but always ensure they align with industry best practices and security standards.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you encounter any challenges or need clarification.",
  "It's important that we maintain consistency and best practices across our team.",
  "Firstly, I want you to always include assert statements in your functions.",
  "This helps with code validation and ensures that the function is used correctly.",
  "Also, from now on, I need you to start all your function names with a specific prefix.",
  "Let's use 'c_' as the standard prefix for our team.",
  "This helps us quickly identify our code within the larger codebase.",
  "Consistency is key, and these practices will help us maintain a high standard of code quality.",
  "I'll provide you with some of our standard scripts and functions to get you started."
 ],
